(3649351, 510228, 35352, '<td valign="top">A great b+w photo. It''s really in the style of an 80s ablum cover. The greass at the top is overexposure but I think it adds to the 80s feel. Great subjects too. A bit of grain around the light but I find it''s hard to get rid of it around bright lights in night photos.</td>', 'A great b+w photo. It''s really in the style of an 80s ablum cover. The greass at the top is overexposure but I think it adds to the 80s feel. Great subjects too. A bit of grain around the light but I find it''s hard to get rid of it around bright lights in night photos.', '2007-05-14 23:01:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3649352, 510559, 61073, '<td valign="top">ouch!!!!!!!</td>', 'ouch!!!!!!!', '2007-05-14 23:01:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3649357, 511361, 35352, '<td valign="top">I like the segmentation of the colours and regions in this photo. Theres a calmness that goes with the album title. Those pink flowers are so clear and detailed. well done!</td>', 'I like the segmentation of the colours and regions in this photo. Theres a calmness that goes with the album title. Those pink flowers are so clear and detailed. well done!', '2007-05-14 23:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3649370, 510561, 35352, '<td valign="top">The snakes head needs a bit more focus and some better lighting. Its really the focus of the photo. Nice DOF.</td>', 'The snakes head needs a bit more focus and some better lighting. Its really the focus of the photo. Nice DOF.', '2007-05-14 23:06:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3649387, 510521, 35352, '<td valign="top">I think for this challenge, you really need your photo the size of a standard album and to have some text on it. THis is a very interesting photo though, the pink dots are great!</td>', 'I think for this challenge, you really need your photo the size of a standard album and to have some text on it. THis is a very interesting photo though, the pink dots are great!', '2007-05-14 23:11:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3649396, 511135, 35352, '<td valign="top">I love the right hand side of this album cover - some of the detail seems lost of the left hand side - lost into the purple.</td>', 'I love the right hand side of this album cover - some of the detail seems lost of the left hand side - lost into the purple.', '2007-05-14 23:12:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3649414, 510837, 35352, '<td valign="top">Might be better a little brighter or more contrast. I''d also crop out all of the roof and show some more porch. The mood of the photo really goes with the type of music I think would be on this album.</td>', 'Might be better a little brighter or more contrast. I''d also crop out all of the roof and show some more porch. The mood of the photo really goes with the type of music I think would be on this album.', '2007-05-14 23:17:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3649420, 510765, 35352, '<td valign="top">This is great - I love the colours and the clarity of the kids. The rest of the scene is blurred just right! Its a pity the horse is the same colour as the surrounds though.</td>', 'This is great - I love the colours and the clarity of the kids. The rest of the scene is blurred just right! Its a pity the horse is the same colour as the surrounds though.', '2007-05-14 23:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3649435, 510166, 35352, '<td valign="top">Very nice DOF and lighting. The test is a little too close the one of the strings. Otherwise, I like the use of space here - just the right amount used by the guitar.</td>', 'Very nice DOF and lighting. The test is a little too close the one of the strings. Otherwise, I like the use of space here - just the right amount used by the guitar.', '2007-05-14 23:22:31.000000', NULL, 1),
