(3649471, 511391, 35352, '<td valign="top">Very arty, great for an album cover. This would be spectacular with better lighting. The walls and floors are a lit too monotonous.</td>', 'Very arty, great for an album cover. This would be spectacular with better lighting. The walls and floors are a lit too monotonous.', '2007-05-14 23:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
