(3649618, 511398, 49321, '<td valign="top">Great exposure. The composition seems a bit off. I think it would look nice if the corner of the main building in the top left was the corner of the picture. Excellent b&amp;w conversion, the blown out spot in the sky is a bit distracting, the only to avoid that would be to come back at a different time, but you may have lost some of th shadows on te building.<br/> <br/>I really like the name as well.</td>', 'Great exposure. The composition seems a bit off. I think it would look nice if the corner of the main building in the top left was the corner of the picture. Excellent b&w conversion, the blown out spot in the sky is a bit distracting, the only to avoid that would be to come back at a different time, but you may have lost some of th shadows on te building. I really like the name as well.', '2007-05-14 23:59:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3649620, 510678, 69668, '<td valign="top">This has to be my favorite of all the titles.  I said out loud in a empty "Now that is just my kind of funny".  I love it.  A 10 from me for originality, and creativeness.</td>', 'This has to be my favorite of all the titles.  I said out loud in a empty "Now that is just my kind of funny".  I love it.  A 10 from me for originality, and creativeness.', '2007-05-15 00:00:36.000000', NULL, 1),
