(3651905, 511162, 58452, '<td valign="top">Even with the much done veil/shawl I like the way the lines carry the eyes around the frame, back to the title again as you take in the face.  Must be natural light, and the catch lights just don''t do much for me.  Still one of the best and will probably top ten.</td>', 'Even with the much done veil/shawl I like the way the lines carry the eyes around the frame, back to the title again as you take in the face.  Must be natural light, and the catch lights just don''t do much for me.  Still one of the best and will probably top ten.', '2007-05-15 16:00:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3651929, 510567, 58452, '<td valign="top">It''s guess the Icelander time again!  ;) Maybe I''m wrong.  Great cover.  Excellent layout.  Like the flash star and the rim accenting on the five fingers.  Even the minimalist right corner frame balances well with the title.  My choice for the blue.</td>', 'It''s guess the Icelander time again!  ;) Maybe I''m wrong.  Great cover.  Excellent layout.  Like the flash star and the rim accenting on the five fingers.  Even the minimalist right corner frame balances well with the title.  My choice for the blue.', '2007-05-15 16:06:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(3651941, 511398, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice PP on this one.  Actually looks like a cover I''ve seen somewhere.  Been through my stack and can''t find it.  At first I didn''t like the red sticker, but came to appreciate how it added some realism to the cover.  Should top ten.</td>', 'Nice PP on this one.  Actually looks like a cover I''ve seen somewhere.  Been through my stack and can''t find it.  At first I didn''t like the red sticker, but came to appreciate how it added some realism to the cover.  Should top ten.', '2007-05-15 16:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3651958, 511127, 58452, '<td valign="top">Love the way the shape of the cats head is lost to the darkness.  You''re left only with the features of its face. The patterns in the large text don''t add much IMO.  The small title text goes well with the whiskers. There''s something disturbingly unnatural about the pupils.  But it''s a good thing.  This should easily top ten.</td>', 'Love the way the shape of the cats head is lost to the darkness.  You''re left only with the features of its face. The patterns in the large text don''t add much IMO.  The small title text goes well with the whiskers. There''s something disturbingly unnatural about the pupils.  But it''s a good thing.  This should easily top ten.', '2007-05-15 16:13:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3651969, 511055, 58452, '<td valign="top">ROTFLMAO Excellent composition, and creative titles.  ;) White spot in the lower right bokeh detracts a little as well as the vertical line at the top left extending through Larry and Lisa''s "tails". heheh  Only a nit pik though.  This should easily top ten.</td>', 'ROTFLMAO Excellent composition, and creative titles.  ;) White spot in the lower right bokeh detracts a little as well as the vertical line at the top left extending through Larry and Lisa''s "tails". heheh  Only a nit pik though.  This should easily top ten.', '2007-05-15 16:17:11.000000', NULL, 1),
