(3651989, 509604, 58452, '<td valign="top">Nice salmon grad  across the sky.  Lots of potential for the site.  Next time hide your bike and unfinished drink.  If you could have moved the camera position to the left some and framed the terrain and tanker into the portal I think it would have helped this shot. This would probably put the sun in the frame and maybe ruined your idea.  I like this one a lot.  Should top ten.</td>', 'Nice salmon grad  across the sky.  Lots of potential for the site.  Next time hide your bike and unfinished drink.  If you could have moved the camera position to the left some and framed the terrain and tanker into the portal I think it would have helped this shot. This would probably put the sun in the frame and maybe ruined your idea.  I like this one a lot.  Should top ten.', '2007-05-15 16:26:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3652088, 511450, 30049, '<td valign="top">There''s a poster in here somewhere.  :D  One of my top picks.  Wonderful job of controlling DOF to keep the nose and "face" sharp while nicely blurring out the bg.  Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'There''s a poster in here somewhere.  :D  One of my top picks.  Wonderful job of controlling DOF to keep the nose and "face" sharp while nicely blurring out the bg.  Good luck in the challenge.', '2007-05-15 16:50:51.000000', NULL, 1),
