(3653497, 511269, 53316, '<td valign="top">Awesome.  A photo that has a graphic-design-ey feel... Don''t know if this makes sense but, I want to say that this stands out from a lot of others because it looks like it was just MADE to be an album cover, instead of an album person just happening to pick a picture that fit.</td>', 'Awesome.  A photo that has a graphic-design-ey feel... Don''t know if this makes sense but, I want to say that this stands out from a lot of others because it looks like it was just MADE to be an album cover, instead of an album person just happening to pick a picture that fit.', '2007-05-16 00:15:45.000000', NULL, 1),
