(3653510, 509268, 53316, '<td valign="top">Font = amazing. I think the band Like Summer used or used to use it, and... hm wait a minute, I think they might have even used the dot things too.  Weird... ''cause it''s not a very well-known band.</td>', 'Font = amazing. I think the band Like Summer used or used to use it, and... hm wait a minute, I think they might have even used the dot things too.  Weird... ''cause it''s not a very well-known band.', '2007-05-16 00:17:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(3653512, 511451, 53316, '<td valign="top">I wish the text had not been obscured by the black, but otherwise this is good - especially the lighting.</td>', 'I wish the text had not been obscured by the black, but otherwise this is good - especially the lighting.', '2007-05-16 00:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3653514, 511447, 53316, '<td valign="top">With this type of photographic technique it is so easy to let things get too orange.  I''ve learned that using selective color to darken the blacks and whiten the whites helps a lot, as well as using levels to balance out the too-orange feel.  Overall though I like this! Composition especially is nice.</td>', 'With this type of photographic technique it is so easy to let things get too orange.  I''ve learned that using selective color to darken the blacks and whiten the whites helps a lot, as well as using levels to balance out the too-orange feel.  Overall though I like this! Composition especially is nice.', '2007-05-16 00:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3653703, 511349, 15511, '<td valign="top">Hey! Hey! We''re the... uhh, never mind!</td>', 'Hey! Hey! We''re the... uhh, never mind!', '2007-05-16 01:13:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(3654076, 511135, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool image. The name is good. I could see this as an album cover. Great job.</td>', 'This is a very cool image. The name is good. I could see this as an album cover. Great job.', '2007-05-16 02:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(3654104, 511442, 19831, '<td valign="top">Wowsers, this is an awesome entry for the challenge. First, it''s a really great photo. Visually, very appealing, technically very well done. Secondly, it''s a good name, that works. Then, the album title, along with the name, and the concept of the image, all ties together and works great. The design is very good, I can really see this as an album cover, you should design them for real! :-) The colors all work great. I love how you''ve got the noodle laces of both shoes all tied together, it really drives the whole concept home. Super job! High score from me :-)</td>', 'Wowsers, this is an awesome entry for the challenge. First, it''s a really great photo. Visually, very appealing, technically very well done. Secondly, it''s a good name, that works. Then, the album title, along with the name, and the concept of the image, all ties together and works great. The design is very good, I can really see this as an album cover, you should design them for real! :-) The colors all work great. I love how you''ve got the noodle laces of both shoes all tied together, it really drives the whole concept home. Super job! High score from me :-)', '2007-05-16 02:32:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3654110, 510411, 19831, '<td valign="top">OMG, that''s hilarious! But it works :-) The processing fits. Nice job.</td>', 'OMG, that''s hilarious! But it works :-) The processing fits. Nice job.', '2007-05-16 02:34:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3654124, 511439, 65858, '<td valign="top">LOLOLOL!!!  Holy crap that''s a funny title!  10!!</td>', 'LOLOLOL!!!  Holy crap that''s a funny title!  10!!', '2007-05-16 02:36:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3654142, 511262, 65858, '<td valign="top">=D  Hilarious!</td>', '=D  Hilarious!', '2007-05-16 02:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
