(3654494, 511211, 30982, '<td valign="top">What I quite like about this one is if you really take a look at the duck, it looks as though his beak really, really does not go with the rest of his head.  What a strange sense of humor Mother Nature has!</td>', 'What I quite like about this one is if you really take a look at the duck, it looks as though his beak really, really does not go with the rest of his head.  What a strange sense of humor Mother Nature has!', '2007-05-16 07:20:42.000000', NULL, 1),
