(3654500, 509941, 30982, '<td valign="top">Very adorable!  I like the painterly kinda feeling of this and the soft color.</td>', 'Very adorable!  I like the painterly kinda feeling of this and the soft color.', '2007-05-16 07:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
