(3660929, 510312, 3087, '<td valign="top">I quite like the fact that the band name isn''t so desperately linked to the image. The image does relate well to the album title. I like it. The lighting on that leaf is lovely even though I''m not so keen on the slighly odd cut-out feel of the leaf edge.</td>', 'I quite like the fact that the band name isn''t so desperately linked to the image. The image does relate well to the album title. I like it. The lighting on that leaf is lovely even though I''m not so keen on the slighly odd cut-out feel of the leaf edge.', '2007-05-17 18:25:14.000000', NULL, 1),
