(3660941, 509604, 3087, '<td valign="top">Cool picture! Not sure the positioning of the text worls that well - just doesn''t feel balanced. I can see you''ve centred it ovre the arms of the sculpture but it doesn''t work well there for me. The image itself I think is just great - great light, wonderfully quirky silhouette subject with interesting little details like part of a bike, the ships behind and so on.</td>', 'Cool picture! Not sure the positioning of the text worls that well - just doesn''t feel balanced. I can see you''ve centred it ovre the arms of the sculpture but it doesn''t work well there for me. The image itself I think is just great - great light, wonderfully quirky silhouette subject with interesting little details like part of a bike, the ships behind and so on.', '2007-05-17 18:27:18.000000', NULL, 1),
