(3660947, 511338, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the image a lot - the way so much of it is dark except for the hand really pulls focus to the hand and gun and yet there''s still detail in the jacket and smoke too. The text positioning works though I think the band name would be better un-angled, myself.</td>', 'I like the image a lot - the way so much of it is dark except for the hand really pulls focus to the hand and gun and yet there''s still detail in the jacket and smoke too. The text positioning works though I think the band name would be better un-angled, myself.', '2007-05-17 18:28:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660948, 510995, 3087, '<td valign="top">This works! It''s absolutely something I''d expect to see on a real album cover. I like your band name, doesn''t sound half as contrived and unlikely as most in the challenge (though I know most are tongue in cheek). I like the image too, oddly enough.</td>', 'This works! It''s absolutely something I''d expect to see on a real album cover. I like your band name, doesn''t sound half as contrived and unlikely as most in the challenge (though I know most are tongue in cheek). I like the image too, oddly enough.', '2007-05-17 18:30:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660952, 511362, 3087, '<td valign="top">I like the image, especially the intimacy of the up-close crop. I think the extremely high contrast works well to really reduce the face to it''s essence and yet still enough detail to recognise it clearly. Like the red and black too. All good. Something I can absolutely see on a real album cover.</td>', 'I like the image, especially the intimacy of the up-close crop. I think the extremely high contrast works well to really reduce the face to it''s essence and yet still enough detail to recognise it clearly. Like the red and black too. All good. Something I can absolutely see on a real album cover.', '2007-05-17 18:31:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660957, 511451, 3087, '<td valign="top">Wow. What an intriguing image. Really interesting. Like that spot lighting and the colour temperature too. Personally I think it would be stronger in a square crop, losing from the left side only, so his back is near the left edge and he''s facing into the main space of the image. Band name could fit in at lower right or upper right. But works well as is too.</td>', 'Wow. What an intriguing image. Really interesting. Like that spot lighting and the colour temperature too. Personally I think it would be stronger in a square crop, losing from the left side only, so his back is near the left edge and he''s facing into the main space of the image. Band name could fit in at lower right or upper right. But works well as is too.', '2007-05-17 18:33:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660959, 511442, 3087, '<td valign="top">Nicely done!</td>', 'Nicely done!', '2007-05-17 18:33:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660961, 509268, 61961, '<td valign="top">I had to go on the internet to find out what I thought "Rizla" was a label on one of the videotapes -- I had to go on the internet to find out what it means. :-)</td>', 'I had to go on the internet to find out what I thought "Rizla" was a label on one of the videotapes -- I had to go on the internet to find out what it means. :-)', '2007-05-17 18:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3660962, 511394, 3087, '<td valign="top">I love the composition, the interesting detail, the colour cast and the wonderful grain. Absolutely works for me.</td>', 'I love the composition, the interesting detail, the colour cast and the wonderful grain. Absolutely works for me.', '2007-05-17 18:34:31.000000', NULL, 1),
