(3662608, 510995, 16004, '<td valign="top">OK, guilty of cherry picking the first one i''m voting on; from all the thumbnails it was this I was first drawn to.  Might be purely coincidental, but you also appear to be much of a coldplay fan (font, the Don''t Panic bit from their blue room ep).  Gives an air of autheticity about it.  The image itself is very nice; technically flawed but in a good stylish way, soulful, quite moody, very fitting.  says a lot too; journeys, music on the radio... makes one thoughtful. this photo could only ever be on a record sleeve.   <br/> <br/>My First Weighted Scoring System ; composition + technical 2/3, challenge 1/1, post processing results 1.5/2, ooooh factor 3/3, originality 0.75/1 = 8.25 (rounded to 8)</td>', 'OK, guilty of cherry picking the first one i''m voting on; from all the thumbnails it was this I was first drawn to.  Might be purely coincidental, but you also appear to be much of a coldplay fan (font, the Don''t Panic bit from their blue room ep).  Gives an air of autheticity about it.  The image itself is very nice; technically flawed but in a good stylish way, soulful, quite moody, very fitting.  says a lot too; journeys, music on the radio... makes one thoughtful. this photo could only ever be on a record sleeve.    My First Weighted Scoring System ; composition + technical 2/3, challenge 1/1, post processing results 1.5/2, ooooh factor 3/3, originality 0.75/1 = 8.25 (rounded to 8)', '2007-05-18 07:42:56.000000', NULL, 1),
