(3668190, 510837, 53316, '<td valign="top">The photo itself could use some more contrast but I do like the unorthodox centered composition.</td>', 'The photo itself could use some more contrast but I do like the unorthodox centered composition.', '2007-05-20 03:42:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668191, 509212, 53316, '<td valign="top">Sharper text would have been nice although I do love the font. Great perspective on the image.</td>', 'Sharper text would have been nice although I do love the font. Great perspective on the image.', '2007-05-20 03:42:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668195, 511177, 53316, '<td valign="top">The image is FANTASTIC. It really conveys your title. The women are lovely and really compliment the look of each other nicely.  Makeup seems to be chosen with care as the colors are nice together.  The neat-imaged look is usually bad for portraits when it is overdone but it works BEAUTIFULLY here.  I love how the faces are symmetrical but still have these asyemetries about them, such as eyebrow shape and hair on the forehead; makes things very interesting.  I also really like the two smiles that are at the same intensity - not too much of a smile, but enough.  Only things I would suggest on the image are maybe to get rid of so many reflections in the eyes, and possibly (but this is drawn attention to with the text and wouldn''t be so bad with the image alone) have the hair arranged so there is no background showing.  Other than that, it''s just really spectacular. I could really see the image being used to promote these two women in a band.<br/> <br/>But I will be honest with you. I feel like this is so far underneath what it could have been.  That is because of the text.  The font seems horribly cheesy to me! I feel like it simply does not in any way do this lovely image justice. I still gave you a good score but it would have, with a nicely elegant, or simple and understated text, been a ten.</td>', 'The image is FANTASTIC. It really conveys your title. The women are lovely and really compliment the look of each other nicely.  Makeup seems to be chosen with care as the colors are nice together.  The neat-imaged look is usually bad for portraits when it is overdone but it works BEAUTIFULLY here.  I love how the faces are symmetrical but still have these asyemetries about them, such as eyebrow shape and hair on the forehead; makes things very interesting.  I also really like the two smiles that are at the same intensity - not too much of a smile, but enough.  Only things I would suggest on the image are maybe to get rid of so many reflections in the eyes, and possibly (but this is drawn attention to with the text and wouldn''t be so bad with the image alone) have the hair arranged so there is no background showing.  Other than that, it''s just really spectacular. I could really see the image being used to promote these two women in a band. But I will be honest with you. I feel like this is so far underneath what it could have been.  That is because of the text.  The font seems horribly cheesy to me! I feel like it simply does not in any way do this lovely image justice. I still gave you a good score but it would have, with a nicely elegant, or simple and understated text, been a ten.', '2007-05-20 03:49:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(3668196, 509604, 53316, '<td valign="top">Ooooh, great matching of image and title!!</td>', 'Ooooh, great matching of image and title!!', '2007-05-20 03:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
