(3669344, 511238, 62787, '<td valign="top">Ooh, the comments you could make about the influence of a bright-coloured consumerist society and the bad effects of bringing up kids to associate sweets with affection...<br/>Other than that, nice picture :) <br/> <br/>I really like the DOF, composition and background. And the colours are very pretty. Not sure about the glare on the glass/plastic/whatever, maybe a polarizer would''ve helped?</td>', 'Ooh, the comments you could make about the influence of a bright-coloured consumerist society and the bad effects of bringing up kids to associate sweets with affection...Other than that, nice picture :)  I really like the DOF, composition and background. And the colours are very pretty. Not sure about the glare on the glass/plastic/whatever, maybe a polarizer would''ve helped?', '2007-05-20 15:19:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3669346, 511421, 70270, '<td valign="top">My favorite use of the "DPL" initials for your band name, a good title that fits the image, and a nice picture that really looks like an album cover.  Lenore is a little soft on the focus, but other than that I think this is great, and a top 10 for sure.  8.</td>', 'My favorite use of the "DPL" initials for your band name, a good title that fits the image, and a nice picture that really looks like an album cover.  Lenore is a little soft on the focus, but other than that I think this is great, and a top 10 for sure.  8.', '2007-05-20 15:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
