(3669371, 510720, 67258, '<td valign="top">Very original - love the photography parephanalia!  There is so much to see here; in virtually any other challenge the photo would be too too cluttered, but as part of the album cover it works for me.</td>', 'Very original - love the photography parephanalia!  There is so much to see here; in virtually any other challenge the photo would be too too cluttered, but as part of the album cover it works for me.', '2007-05-20 15:26:40.000000', NULL, 1),
