(3669383, 511450, 62787, '<td valign="top">Wow, the expression on the dog''s face is just perfect! You expect him to open his mouth and start singing the blues in a voice any minute now...<br/> <br/> <br/>While the facial expression and the blurred colour background work very well together, I think the picture would be much better if the entirety of the dog was sharply in focus (or at least more of it anyway). Dunno if the shutter speed or the DOF is to blame (probably the latter?), but it''d be something I''d change.<br/> <br/>Well done though, very cool picture :)</td>', 'Wow, the expression on the dog''s face is just perfect! You expect him to open his mouth and start singing the blues in a voice any minute now...  While the facial expression and the blurred colour background work very well together, I think the picture would be much better if the entirety of the dog was sharply in focus (or at least more of it anyway). Dunno if the shutter speed or the DOF is to blame (probably the latter?), but it''d be something I''d change. Well done though, very cool picture :)', '2007-05-20 15:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
