(3670144, 510918, 69487, '<td valign="top">Well im sad to see the crop and no text.  The lighting is nice even though it looks to be a bit off to the side.  Not sure if a fill flash was used or not.  Girls look familiar, If i had to guess id have to say the Photographer was Cindi.... but my guessing is usually only 50% right.</td>', 'Well im sad to see the crop and no text.  The lighting is nice even though it looks to be a bit off to the side.  Not sure if a fill flash was used or not.  Girls look familiar, If i had to guess id have to say the Photographer was Cindi.... but my guessing is usually only 50% right.', '2007-05-20 19:43:59.000000', NULL, 1),
