(3670221, 511298, 50695, '<td valign="top">DPL was formed by three people who had the same dream... every night. Isadora Duncan would approach them, wearing only a scarf and a hatband. She would just stare at them. She said she needed new music to dance to. They would wake up with their heads full of melodies... the same melodies. One learned to play the violin, another the bass, and the third learned to sing and play the piano. They made one magnificent album and then after that... they stopped dreaming.<br/> <br/>10</td>', 'DPL was formed by three people who had the same dream... every night. Isadora Duncan would approach them, wearing only a scarf and a hatband. She would just stare at them. She said she needed new music to dance to. They would wake up with their heads full of melodies... the same melodies. One learned to play the violin, another the bass, and the third learned to sing and play the piano. They made one magnificent album and then after that... they stopped dreaming. 10', '2007-05-20 20:00:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(3670234, 509567, 50695, '<td valign="top">This looks more like a promotional photo than an album cover. 4</td>', 'This looks more like a promotional photo than an album cover. 4', '2007-05-20 20:03:58.000000', NULL, 1),
