(3672200, 510837, 31534, '<td valign="top">Hello from the Critique Club<br/> <br/>First Impression, <br/> <br/>Look like a country cover.<br/> <br/>Technically.Nice details, door looks a little grainy compared to the rest of the picture. <br/> <br/>Composition. <br/> <br/>I like the set up of the picture,has an old feel to it. I would have like to have more porch roof in the picture.<br/> <br/>Editing.. Feel just a little dark, could have used some color on the guitar.. with the advanced editing. <br/> <br/>Over all a good picture and nice finish. Congrats<br/> <br/>Best of luck in future challenges. <br/> <br/>Karen <br/> <br/></td>', 'Hello from the Critique Club First Impression,  Look like a country cover. Technically.Nice details, door looks a little grainy compared to the rest of the picture.  Composition.  I like the set up of the picture,has an old feel to it. I would have like to have more porch roof in the picture. Editing.. Feel just a little dark, could have used some color on the guitar.. with the advanced editing.  Over all a good picture and nice finish. Congrats Best of luck in future challenges.  Karen  ', '2007-05-21 01:36:15.000000', NULL, 0),
