(3672589, 509246, 34938, '<td valign="top">Doc, Doc, Doc...what were you thinking? LOL That is psychadelic, supercalofragelistic man. I thought it was something you''d expect from KTel. I was going to leave a comment picking on the font and the cheesy layout not knowing it was you. Good thing I didn''t. <br/> <br/>Your photography is HOT, but your desktop publishing methods...well...I''d better not say. Makes me feel better. We finally found a chink in his armour. <br/> <br/>I am writing to site council and asking them to make all future challenges include text...<br/> <br/>You are fantastic man...I am in Nairobi laughing my head off...<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-21 02:04:04.</i></td>', 'Doc, Doc, Doc...what were you thinking? LOL That is psychadelic, supercalofragelistic man. I thought it was something you''d expect from KTel. I was going to leave a comment picking on the font and the cheesy layout not knowing it was you. Good thing I didn''t.  Your photography is HOT, but your desktop publishing methods...well...I''d better not say. Makes me feel better. We finally found a chink in his armour.  I am writing to site council and asking them to make all future challenges include text... You are fantastic man...I am in Nairobi laughing my head off...', '2007-05-21 03:02:44.000000', '2007-05-21 03:04:04.000000', 0),
