(3673784, 511258, 51538, '<td valign="top">The idea is creative and "advanced" yet the colour and levels seem "basic" to me.  Perhaps desat the background - probably talking out of my hat here...</td>', 'The idea is creative and "advanced" yet the colour and levels seem "basic" to me.  Perhaps desat the background - probably talking out of my hat here...', '2007-05-21 11:09:55.000000', NULL, 0),
(3673844, 511211, 45524, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the critique club. First I''d like to point out that I''m pretty sure this specimen is a goose not a duck. That may have been a problem with the voters. I like the good focus, lighting and the use of OoF background Bokeh to bring the viewer to the title and to the Subject. I think what really hurt you was the fact that you had the wrong animal for the title. Good luck in future challenges.</td>', 'Greetings from the critique club. First I''d like to point out that I''m pretty sure this specimen is a goose not a duck. That may have been a problem with the voters. I like the good focus, lighting and the use of OoF background Bokeh to bring the viewer to the title and to the Subject. I think what really hurt you was the fact that you had the wrong animal for the title. Good luck in future challenges.', '2007-05-21 11:18:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(3673849, 511177, 76766, '<td valign="top">I keep coming back to this one. The similarity of their skin- the porcelain effect- really draws my attention again and again to their differences. Their eyes, eyebrows,lips, noses. Good job!</td>', 'I keep coming back to this one. The similarity of their skin- the porcelain effect- really draws my attention again and again to their differences. Their eyes, eyebrows,lips, noses. Good job!', '2007-05-21 11:19:02.000000', NULL, 0),
