(3674256, 511298, 66384, '<td valign="top">Once again, I like your entry a lot. The left shoulder looks a little bony and attracts my attention too much, but I love the processing and of course the model.<br/> <br/>edit: Oh, I am understanding the shoulder better now. That is the scarf causing the bony effect. <br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-21 11:39:33.</i></td>', 'Once again, I like your entry a lot. The left shoulder looks a little bony and attracts my attention too much, but I love the processing and of course the model. edit: Oh, I am understanding the shoulder better now. That is the scarf causing the bony effect. ', '2007-05-21 12:35:09.000000', '2007-05-21 12:39:33.000000', 0),
