(3682046, 509412, 811, '<td valign="top">CRITIQUE CLUB CRITIQUE<br/>by karmat<br/> <br/>Nicely shot.<br/> <br/>Compositionally, I like your use of negative space and how the guitarist and text balance each other.  <br/> <br/>Technically, I like the colors and textures in this shot.  I really, really like the concrete wall.  For some reason, that really gives it an edge that would be lost with a typical photography background.  The lighting is what I think is the strongest, though.  It is dramatic without be overly so, or too harsh.  The shadow is very effective as well.<br/> <br/>So, I''m studying it to see what I could possibly suggest to get a higher score, and *wow* -- he''s barefooted.  That is cool.<br/> <br/>I honestly don''t know what I could suggest for improving this.  I can only suspect that the one comment below that gave you a three for not having a "band" is the mindset of the other lower votes.  I dunno.  It never struck me that "David Patterson - -Live" couldn''t be a band.  But, then, I am just weird, I guess.<br/> <br/>Nice work.<br/> <br/>Karma</td>', 'CRITIQUE CLUB CRITIQUEby karmat Nicely shot. Compositionally, I like your use of negative space and how the guitarist and text balance each other.   Technically, I like the colors and textures in this shot.  I really, really like the concrete wall.  For some reason, that really gives it an edge that would be lost with a typical photography background.  The lighting is what I think is the strongest, though.  It is dramatic without be overly so, or too harsh.  The shadow is very effective as well. So, I''m studying it to see what I could possibly suggest to get a higher score, and *wow* -- he''s barefooted.  That is cool. I honestly don''t know what I could suggest for improving this.  I can only suspect that the one comment below that gave you a three for not having a "band" is the mindset of the other lower votes.  I dunno.  It never struck me that "David Patterson - -Live" couldn''t be a band.  But, then, I am just weird, I guess. Nice work. Karma', '2007-05-22 22:02:39.000000', NULL, 0),
(3682151, 510791, 48228, '<td valign="top">Unusual subject matter here, but gee, it makes a great graphic artistic image here..... <br/>I agree with the comment that the color choice with the green text really takes over, and would love to see it with just the plain black text. <br/>I still think the idea is brilliant. and can see you had fun taking this one.....</td>', 'Unusual subject matter here, but gee, it makes a great graphic artistic image here..... I agree with the comment that the color choice with the green text really takes over, and would love to see it with just the plain black text. I still think the idea is brilliant. and can see you had fun taking this one.....', '2007-05-22 22:17:15.000000', NULL, 0),
