(3690989, 509567, 6388, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Alecia:</b></div><hr/><i> i really like this shot and layout, BUT death metal is not 80''s hair metal! you just can''t compare cannibal corpse to, say, motley crue. <br/> <br/>but i''m really more interested in the props. are you saying that you had those ''nikki sixx'' red striped pants in your props closet? hilarious! and weird. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well duh.  But the title needed to be DPL not EHMPL.  And yes, I had all those props in the closet.  Blame Roz.</td>', 'Originally posted by Alecia: i really like this shot and layout, BUT death metal is not 80''s hair metal! you just can''t compare cannibal corpse to, say, motley crue.  but i''m really more interested in the props. are you saying that you had those ''nikki sixx'' red striped pants in your props closet? hilarious! and weird.   Well duh.  But the title needed to be DPL not EHMPL.  And yes, I had all those props in the closet.  Blame Roz.', '2007-05-24 13:29:22.000000', NULL, 0),
