(3691462, 509567, 38127, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Pedro:</b></div><hr/><i> <table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Alecia:</b></div><hr/><i> i really like this shot and layout, BUT death metal is not 80''s hair metal! you just can''t compare cannibal corpse to, say, motley crue. <br/> <br/>but i''m really more interested in the props. are you saying that you had those ''nikki sixx'' red striped pants in your props closet? hilarious! and weird. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Well duh.  But the title needed to be DPL not EHMPL.  And yes, I had all those props in the closet.  Blame Roz. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>hahah yeah blame Roz... like its an embarassing thing.. <br/>You know he secretly visits the prop closet to try everything I bring over on.. including the stretchy white long dress... ;) Although I''ve begged to see the "nikki sixx" pants on him..but so far nada..he simply refuses ;)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-05-24 15:15:25.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Pedro: Originally posted by Alecia: i really like this shot and layout, BUT death metal is not 80''s hair metal! you just can''t compare cannibal corpse to, say, motley crue.  but i''m really more interested in the props. are you saying that you had those ''nikki sixx'' red striped pants in your props closet? hilarious! and weird.   Well duh.  But the title needed to be DPL not EHMPL.  And yes, I had all those props in the closet.  Blame Roz.   hahah yeah blame Roz... like its an embarassing thing.. You know he secretly visits the prop closet to try everything I bring over on.. including the stretchy white long dress... ;) Although I''ve begged to see the "nikki sixx" pants on him..but so far nada..he simply refuses ;)', '2007-05-24 16:14:33.000000', '2007-05-24 16:15:25.000000', 0),
